          "value": "\n<ol><li>[The slave] kisses the ground before him and reports to his loftiness&mdash;may his favour endure</li>\n<li>and his enemies perish&mdash;that she is a cut-off woman, indigent, poor, who has no</li>\n<li>[one but God and him ....].</li></ol>\n",
